# Brand source artwork (~5 MB original). The shipped assets are derived from it
# and ARE committed: apps/web/public/brand/mark.png, apps/web/src/app/icon.png
# and favicon.ico. Kept out of git so the binary never enters history; keep a
# copy somewhere safe if you ever need to re-crop.
#
# Leading slash matters: without it this would also match
# apps/web/public/brand/, excluding the asset the app actually serves.
/brand/

